 ["A growing pattern gets bigger by a rule. 1, 3, 5, 7 grows by 2 each time. A shrinking pattern gets smaller, like 50, 45, 40.","Some patterns multiply. 2, 4, 8, 16 doubles each time.","To find the rule, look at the difference between numbers next to each other."],
